hifiberry-tidal-connect (2.0.4) stable; urgency=medium

  * Start tdcn again after an upgrade. prerm stops it so the binary is not
    replaced underneath a running daemon, but dh_installsystemduser emits no
    matching restart -- for system units dh_installsystemd restarts after an
    upgrade, its user-unit counterpart does nothing -- so every upgrade left
    the player stopped and the Web UI showing it inactive, with nothing to
    say why. Only started when the unit is enabled, so a player switched off
    deliberately stays off.

